      "content": "Wait, what was that about a goblin's clay statue? I'm not sure I follow that analogy. Can you just stick to the engineering specifics? You were talking about the bitumen viscosity and how it affects the flow during laying—please finish that thought and go into more detail on how that contributes to the cracking.",
